# Netlify Redirects Configuration
# Canonical URL enforcement: force HTTPS non-www

# Redirect www to non-www
https://www.sonexial.com/* https://sonexial.com/:splat 301!
http://www.sonexial.com/* https://sonexial.com/:splat 301!

# Redirect HTTP to HTTPS
http://sonexial.com/* https://sonexial.com/:splat 301!

# Trailing slash consistency (optional - redirects /page to /page/)
# Uncomment if needed:
# /*/  /:splat  301

# Proxy scanner API calls to the Railway agent service
/api/* https://sonexial-agent-production.up.railway.app/api/:splat 200

# Pretty URL rewrites
/about /about.html 200
